<%- include('../sidenavs/user') %>

<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    background: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .dashboard-container {
    padding: 30px 20px;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    margin-left: 320px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .welcome-section {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .welcome-title {
    color: #143f4c;
    font-size: 2.4em;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }


  h2 {
    color: #143f4c;
    font-size: 1.8em;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
</style>
<div class="dashboard-container">
  <div class="welcome-section">
    <h1 class="welcome-title">Welcome to Image Metadata Management System</h1>
    <h2>Help Guide:</h2>
    <p>The Image Metadata Management System is a one-stop portal for handling imaging project metadata for tracking of projects and safekeeping of important image-related information. You can navigate the system through the panel on the left. 
    </p>
    <% if(currentUser.UserType == 'photographerOnly'){%>
    <p>If you are using a newly created photographer account made by your project\'s owner, please change your password as soon as possible</p>
      <%}else{%>
        
    <p>If you have created “photographer” role accounts for your staff during the creation or editing of any projects, please remind them to change their passwords as soon as possible for account security. </p>
        <%}%>
    <p>To start uploading image metadata or registering an imaging project, please click on "Image Metadata Management" or "Project Management" repectively on the sidebar. 
    </p>
  </div>


</div>

<script>
 console.log("current user <%=currentUser.UserType == 'photographerOnly'%>") 
</script></main>